    "sources": [
      "The curators' starter deck for Gwenpool (gwenpool_ptt/decks/gwenpool-pool.json in mc-digital-custom-packs, commit 221b4e4), not the pack author's. Starter deck for Gwenpool with the 'Pool aspect, 42 cards. Built on MarvelCDB with Deadpool standing in for Gwenpool (her pack isn't on MarvelCDB): his 15 hero cards are swapped for hers. The basics lean on her Avenger and Guardian traits (Guardian allies for Team-Building Exercise and Knowhere, Avengers Compound)."
